<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- RadarAtlasWindow — a non-modal, searchable master–detail browser over the WHOLE radar network the
     app can access (operational WSR-88D, research/test, TDWR). Floats over the map (map stays live),
     opened by the "Atlas" key on the bar (left of the Settings cog). Shares the OverlayBar surface
     chrome but is its own larger footprint. Bound to the coordinator
     MapViewModel (like SettingsWindow): it reaches into ViewModel.RadarAtlas.* for the list/detail
     and ViewModel.IsRadarAtlasOpen for its own visibility/close.

       Radar Atlas   118 of 204                       [lock][pin]   ← own title + live count
       [ Search ICAO or name…    ] [All networks ▾] [x] Online only [x] Favorites only
       ┌── list (360px, NO outline) ──┐←32→ detail (scrolls, capped 760 wide, LEFT-aligned, 24 below search)
       │ HOME                        │   KTLX   (● Online ⑦) (NEXRAD ⑦) [★] [⌂ Home site] [On map]
       │██ KTLX ⌂ Norman       ◗ ☆ │   Norman                     ← a row is a KEY: status BAR (½ square) | name | network bar | ☆
       │ FAVORITES · 2               │
       │██ TMCI Kansas City    ✈ ★ │   ┌─ site card ──────────────────────────────────────────┐
       │ ALL SITES · 201             │   │ LATEST SCAN  12:06 PM (4 min ago)  ┌──────────────┐ │
       │██ KABR Aberdeen       ◗ ☆ │   │ SCAN MODE    VCP 35 · clear-air    │ [cam]        │ │ ← PLACEHOLDER
       │ …                           │   │ COORDINATES  35.333, -97.278   ⑦   │ Site photo   │ │   200×113, INSET surface
       │                             │   └────────────────────────────────────└──────────────┘─┘
       │                             │   ┌ 4 min     ⑦┐ ┌ VCP 35    ⑦┐ ┌ 142 mi    ⑦┐ ← stat strip: the
       │                             │   │ SINCE LAST │ │ clear-air  │ │ FROM YOU   │   same facts, said short
       └─────────────────────────────┘   └ SCAN ──────┘ └────────────┘ └────────────┘   (distance collapses)

     ⑦ = GlossaryHint, the "?" that explains one readout (Primitives/GlossaryHint + Core's RadarGlossary).
     ⚠️ HOVER TARGET IS THE "?" ONLY, never the tile — someone who knows what a VCP is shouldn't trip a
     popover just crossing the pane. The words live in Core, NEVER in this XAML.
     ⚠️ CARD = PRECISE (clock time, full mode line), STRIP = GLANCEABLE (an age, the VCP alone). Both read the
     same properties, so they can't disagree; the age tile's green→amber→red knees are the glossary's own.

     SECTIONS (Home / Favorites · n / All sites · n) come from a grouped CollectionViewSource over
     RadarAtlas.SiteGroups. ⚠️ Its Source is set in code when ViewModel lands (OnViewModelChanged) — a CVS
     can't x:Bind — and it must land BEFORE the SelectedItem binding runs, which the DP callback order gives.
     A row sits in ONE section. The row's ☆/★ toggles favorite without selecting the row; [★] and [⌂] in the
     header act on the selected site (RadarSiteFavoritesViewModel). Home is one site: setting it moves it.

     ROWS ARE KEYS, in the map key's vocabulary without copying it: a card per row (transparent centre at rest,
     lifted on hover), the STATUS block a tall bar
     (width == half the row height) on the left, the NETWORK bar just left of the star (neutral ◗ NEXRAD / blue ✈ TDWR / violet ⚗ research,
     the key's own glyphs as paths). Selected = elevated face + thin accent stroke — quiet on purpose; the map
     key's bright inverted face stays on the MAP only.

     ⚠️ NETWORK ≠ STATUS. The row's right-hand bar (NEXRAD / TDWR / Research, named in its tooltip) and the
     network filter are the radar's NETWORK; the square + STATUS pill are whether data is flowing (green Online · red Offline · grey
     "Checking…" before the first pass). The network read "Operational" once, which looked like a status
     beside a red dot. In PastCast the status is the REPLAY DAY's ("Data on replay day") and the checkbox
     relabels to match. Status comes from RadarSiteRow.Availability, bound DIRECTLY (not through a VM
     snapshot), so a pass that lands while a site is selected updates the pill and dot in place.

     The header owns the action: the button reads "On map" (disabled) while the selected site IS the
     map's site. Chips are neutral pills; only the status dot carries colour. The DISTANCE row collapses
     when there's no location marker, so it never leaves a hole.

     The row's network label sits flush RIGHT only because the item container stretches its content
     (HorizontalContentAlignment=Stretch) — without it the row Grid shrinks and the label hugs the name.
     The photo panel is a dummy: nothing feeds it yet (no bundled per-site photos exist).

     No outer frame in the sketch because there is none in the app either — the OS caption is the only
     chrome, and content extends into it, which is why the title + count row is drawn here.

     The list selection FOLLOWS the map's radar site (marker click → that row selected, scrolled into
     view, even while the window is closed), and "Load on map" greys out while the selected row IS the
     map's site. A search/filter that hides the loaded site keeps it in the detail pane.

     ⚠️ The detail's live scan info has TWO sources, and the split is deliberate: the site the LOOP is
     on reads its time straight off RadarViewModel (no fetch — re-fetching it would download the whole
     chunks listing and clobber the shared live cache), every other site asks
     ILevel2RadarService.GetLatestScanAsync. -->

<UserControl x:Class="Anvil.Controls.Windows.RadarAtlasWindow"
             xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             xmlns:ctl="using:Anvil.Controls.Primitives"
             xmlns:conv="using:Anvil.Converters"
             xmlns:vm="using:Anvil.ViewModels"
             xmlns:win="using:Anvil.Controls.Windows"
             xmlns:d="http://schemas.microsoft.com/expression/blend/2008"
             xmlns:mc="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006"
             mc:Ignorable="d">

    <UserControl.Resources>
        <conv:SiteAvailabilityToBrushConverter x:Key="AvailabilityToBrush"/>

        <!-- The list's sections. Source set in code-behind (see the header). -->
        <CollectionViewSource x:Key="SiteGroupsSource" IsSourceGrouped="True"/>

        <!-- Small caps field label in the detail pane. -->
        <Style x:Key="FieldLabelStyle" TargetType="TextBlock">
            <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="11"/>
            <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
            <Setter Property="CharacterSpacing" Value="40"/>
            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"/>
        </Style>
        <Style x:Key="FieldValueStyle" TargetType="TextBlock">
            <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="14"/>
            <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{ThemeResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}"/>
        </Style>
    </UserControl.Resources>

    <!-- Root Grid -->
    <!-- Dark surface fills the whole window; content sits top-left. -->
    <Grid Background="{ThemeResource OverlayBarSurfaceBrush}">
            <Grid RowSpacing="10">

                <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                    <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/> <!-- title -->
                    <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/> <!-- search + filters -->
                    <RowDefinition Height="*"/>    <!-- body: list | detail -->
                </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                <!-- Content extends into the title bar (the native caption shows only the buttons), so
                     the panel carries its own title + the live result count. -->
                <Grid Grid.Row="0" Margin="16,14,16,0" ColumnSpacing="12">
                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="Radar Atlas"
                               FontSize="15" FontWeight="SemiBold" CharacterSpacing="40"
                               VerticalAlignment="Center"
                               Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1"
                               Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.ResultCountText, Mode=OneWay}"
                               FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                               Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"/>
                </Grid>

                <!-- Search + filters. -->
                <Grid Grid.Row="1" Margin="16,0,16,0" ColumnSpacing="10">
                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                    <TextBox Grid.Column="0"
                             PlaceholderText="Search ICAO or name…"
                             Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.SearchText, Mode=TwoWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}"/>
                    <ComboBox Grid.Column="1" MinWidth="130"
                              SelectedIndex="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.SelectedClassIndex, Mode=TwoWay}"
                              ToolTipService.ToolTip="Filter by network">
                        <ComboBoxItem Content="All networks"/>
                        <ComboBoxItem Content="NEXRAD"/>
                        <!-- Greyed while Settings → Radar hides the network (the list hides its sites too). -->
                        <ComboBoxItem Content="Research"
                                      IsEnabled="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.IsResearchFilterEnabled, Mode=OneWay}"/>
                        <ComboBoxItem Content="TDWR"
                                      IsEnabled="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.IsTdwrFilterEnabled, Mode=OneWay}"/>
                    </ComboBox>
                    <CheckBox Grid.Column="2" Content="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.OnlineOnlyLabel, Mode=OneWay}"
                              VerticalAlignment="Center"
                              IsChecked="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.OnlineOnly, Mode=TwoWay}"/>
                    <CheckBox Grid.Column="3" Content="Favorites only"
                              VerticalAlignment="Center"
                              IsChecked="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.FavoritesOnly, Mode=TwoWay}"/>
                </Grid>

                <!-- Body: site list (left) | detail (right). Side + bottom inset.
                     ⚠️ THE 32 IS THE SEPARATION. There is no rule and no outline between the two regions —
                     the gutter alone divides them, which is why it can't be trimmed back toward the 14 it
                     used to be. Space between regions must beat the space inside one (the list's own rows
                     sit 6 apart) or the eye can't tell where the list ends. -->
                <Grid Grid.Row="2"
                      Margin="16,0,16,14"
                      ColumnSpacing="32">
                    
                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="360"/>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                    <!-- Left: the filtered site list. NO outline — the gutter separates it from the detail,
                         and a box around rows that are already cards read as a frame inside a frame. -->
                    <Border Grid.Column="0"
                            BorderThickness="0" CornerRadius="8">
                        <ListView ItemsSource="{Binding Source={StaticResource SiteGroupsSource}}"
                                  SelectedItem="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.SelectedSite, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                  SelectionMode="Single"
                                  Loaded="OnSiteListLoaded"
                                  SelectionChanged="OnSiteListSelectionChanged">
                            <ListView.GroupStyle>
                                <GroupStyle>
                                    <GroupStyle.HeaderContainerStyle>
                                        <Style TargetType="ListViewHeaderItem">
                                            <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="0"/>
                                            <Setter Property="Padding" Value="10,10,10,4"/>
                                        </Style>
                                    </GroupStyle.HeaderContainerStyle>
                                    <GroupStyle.HeaderTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate x:DataType="vm:RadarSiteGroup">
                                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Header}" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </GroupStyle.HeaderTemplate>
                                </GroupStyle>
                            </ListView.GroupStyle>
                            <!-- ROWS ARE KEYS — each item is a small card in the map key's vocabulary: TRANSPARENT at
                                 rest with NO stroke (only its square and bar show — filled, outlined cards read crowded),
                                 LIFTED on hover (raised fill + 1 px rise), and a PERMANENT selected state.
                                 ⚠️ The container is RETEMPLATED (no ListViewItemPresenter): the stock selection
                                 wash + accent pill would fight the card. SELECTED is deliberately QUIET — the
                                 elevated surface with a thin accent stroke (the bar's "lit" vocabulary), NOT the
                                 map key's bright inverted face, which reads as a flashlight in a list.
                                 ⚠️ A Border doesn't clip its children to its corners, so the status bar and the
                                 network bar carry their own inner radii (5 = card 6 − its 1 px stroke). -->
                            <ListView.ItemContainerStyle>
                                <Style TargetType="ListViewItem">
                                    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0"/>
                                    <Setter Property="Margin" Value="6,2"/>
                                    <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="0"/>
                                    <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Stretch"/>
                                    <Setter Property="UseSystemFocusVisuals" Value="True"/>
                                    <Setter Property="Template">
                                        <Setter.Value>
                                            <ControlTemplate TargetType="ListViewItem">
                                                <Grid>
                                                    <Grid.RenderTransform>
                                                        <TranslateTransform x:Name="Lift"/>
                                                    </Grid.RenderTransform>
                                                    <VisualStateManager.VisualStateGroups>
                                                        <VisualStateGroup x:Name="CommonStates">
                                                            <!-- RESTING: transparent centre, no stroke (the Card's own defaults) —
                                                                 only the status bar and the network bar read, so a long list
                                                                 stays light instead of a wall of filled cards. -->
                                                            <VisualState x:Name="Normal"/>
                                                            <!-- HOVER LIFTS: the raised surface fills in and the card rises 1 px. -->
                                                            <VisualState x:Name="PointerOver">
                                                                <VisualState.Setters>
                                                                    <Setter Target="Card.Background" Value="{ThemeResource OverlayBarSurfaceRaisedBrush}"/>
                                                                    <Setter Target="Lift.Y" Value="-1"/>
                                                                </VisualState.Setters>
                                                            </VisualState>
                                                            <VisualState x:Name="Pressed">
                                                                <VisualState.Setters>
                                                                    <Setter Target="Card.Background" Value="{ThemeResource OverlayBarSurfaceRaisedHoverBrush}"/>
                                                                </VisualState.Setters>
                                                            </VisualState>
                                                            <!-- SELECTED IS PERMANENT: the same elevated face + accent stroke in all
                                                                 three selected states, so hovering or pressing a selected row never
                                                                 changes how it looks. -->
                                                            <VisualState x:Name="Selected">
                                                                <VisualState.Setters>
                                                                    <Setter Target="Card.Background" Value="{ThemeResource OverlayBarSurfaceElevatedBrush}"/>
                                                                    <Setter Target="Card.BorderBrush" Value="{ThemeResource AccentFillColorDefaultBrush}"/>
                                                                </VisualState.Setters>
                                                            </VisualState>
                                                            <VisualState x:Name="PointerOverSelected">
                                                                <VisualState.Setters>
                                                                    <Setter Target="Card.Background" Value="{ThemeResource OverlayBarSurfaceElevatedBrush}"/>
                                                                    <Setter Target="Card.BorderBrush" Value="{ThemeResource AccentFillColorDefaultBrush}"/>
                                                                </VisualState.Setters>
                                                            </VisualState>
                                                            <VisualState x:Name="PressedSelected">
                                                                <VisualState.Setters>
                                                                    <Setter Target="Card.Background" Value="{ThemeResource OverlayBarSurfaceElevatedBrush}"/>
                                                                    <Setter Target="Card.BorderBrush" Value="{ThemeResource AccentFillColorDefaultBrush}"/>
                                                                </VisualState.Setters>
                                                            </VisualState>
                                                        </VisualStateGroup>
                                                    </VisualStateManager.VisualStateGroups>

                                                    <!-- No stroke at rest or on hover (BorderBrush Transparent); the 1 px
                                                         thickness stays so the selected accent stroke doesn't shift the row. -->
                                                    <Border x:Name="Card"
                                                            CornerRadius="6" BorderThickness="1"
                                                            Background="Transparent"
                                                            BorderBrush="Transparent"/>
                                                    <ContentPresenter Margin="1"
                                                                      Content="{TemplateBinding Content}"
                                                                      ContentTemplate="{TemplateBinding ContentTemplate}"
                                                                      HorizontalContentAlignment="Stretch"
                                                                      VerticalContentAlignment="Stretch"/>
                                                </Grid>
                                            </ControlTemplate>
                                        </Setter.Value>
                                    </Setter>
                                </Style>
                            </ListView.ItemContainerStyle>
                            <ListView.ItemTemplate>
                                <DataTemplate x:DataType="vm:RadarSiteRow">
                                    <!-- The status column is HALF the row's MinHeight (25 of 50), so the colour block is a
                                         2:1 tall bar. Keep the ratio if you retune either. -->
                                    <Grid MinHeight="50">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="25"/>   <!-- status bar (½ MinHeight) -->
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>    <!-- ICAO + name -->
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="40"/>   <!-- network bar (22 px glyph) -->
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/> <!-- favorite -->
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                                        <!-- STATUS — the map key's left zone: a full-height half-width bar, the same literals. -->
                                        <Border Grid.Column="0" CornerRadius="5,0,0,5"
                                                Background="{x:Bind Availability, Converter={StaticResource AvailabilityToBrush}, Mode=OneWay}"/>

                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Margin="12,5" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                                <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Id}" FontWeight="SemiBold" FontSize="15"/>
                                                <FontIcon Glyph="&#xE80F;" FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                          Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"
                                                          Visibility="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.ShowIf(IsHome), Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Name}" FontSize="12"
                                                       TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"
                                                       Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>

                                        <!-- Favorite star: toggles without selecting the row (the Button takes the click). -->
                                        <Button Grid.Column="3" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                Padding="8,4" MinWidth="0" MinHeight="0"
                                                Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0"
                                                Click="OnRowFavoriteClick"
                                                ToolTipService.ToolTip="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.FavoriteToolTip(IsFavorite), Mode=OneWay}">
                                            <FontIcon FontSize="14"
                                                      Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"
                                                      Glyph="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.StarGlyph(IsFavorite), Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                        </Button>

                                        <!-- NETWORK — left of the star: a themed neutral bar for NEXRAD, the data blue /
                                             violet for TDWR / research, each with the key's own glyph (the SVG paths from
                                             radar-sites.js CLASS_GLYPH, redrawn as XAML). Mid-row, so square corners and no
                                             divider hairline. -->
                                        <Grid Grid.Column="2" ToolTipService.ToolTip="{x:Bind ClassLabel}">
                                            <Border Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                            <Border Background="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.NetworkBrush(Site.Class)}"/>

                                            <Viewbox Width="22" Height="22"
                                                     Visibility="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.ClassVisible(Site.Class, 'Operational')}">
                                                <Canvas Width="24" Height="24">
                                                    <Ellipse Canvas.Left="5.6" Canvas.Top="15.6" Width="2.8" Height="2.8"
                                                             Fill="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                                    <Path Data="M7 12.5 A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 11.5 17"
                                                          Stroke="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}" StrokeThickness="2"
                                                          StrokeStartLineCap="Round" StrokeEndLineCap="Round"/>
                                                    <Path Data="M7 7.5 A9.5 9.5 0 0 1 16.5 17"
                                                          Stroke="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}" StrokeThickness="2"
                                                          StrokeStartLineCap="Round" StrokeEndLineCap="Round"/>
                                                </Canvas>
                                            </Viewbox>
                                            <Viewbox Width="22" Height="22"
                                                     Visibility="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.ClassVisible(Site.Class, 'Tdwr')}">
                                                <Canvas Width="24" Height="24">
                                                    <Path Fill="White"
                                                          Data="M12 2 C12.6 2 13 2.9 13 4 V9.2 L20 13.2 V15.1 L13 13.1 V17 L15 18.5 V20 L12 19 L9 20 V18.5 L11 17 V13.1 L4 15.1 V13.2 L11 9.2 V4 C11 2.9 11.4 2 12 2 Z"/>
                                                </Canvas>
                                            </Viewbox>
                                            <Viewbox Width="22" Height="22"
                                                     Visibility="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.ClassVisible(Site.Class, 'Research')}">
                                                <Canvas Width="24" Height="24">
                                                    <Path Data="M9 3 H15" Stroke="White" StrokeThickness="2"
                                                          StrokeStartLineCap="Round" StrokeEndLineCap="Round"/>
                                                    <Path Data="M10 3 V8 L5.6 16.3 A1.9 1.9 0 0 0 7.3 19 H16.7 A1.9 1.9 0 0 0 18.4 16.3 L14 8 V3"
                                                          Stroke="White" StrokeThickness="2" StrokeLineJoin="Round"
                                                          StrokeStartLineCap="Round" StrokeEndLineCap="Round"/>
                                                </Canvas>
                                            </Viewbox>
                                        </Grid>
                                    </Grid>
                                </DataTemplate>
                            </ListView.ItemTemplate>
                        </ListView>
                    </Border>

                    <!-- Right: detail pane for the selected site. Drops 14 further than the list so it clears
                         the search row by 24 in total (the parent's RowSpacing of 10 plus this) — the detail is
                         a fresh region and shouldn't start hard against the filters. -->
                    <Grid Grid.Column="1" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                        <!-- Empty hint when nothing is selected. -->
                        <TextBlock Text="Select a site to see its details."
                                   VerticalAlignment="Center" 
                                   HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                                   Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"
                                   Visibility="{x:Bind CollapsedWhen(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.HasSelection), Mode=OneWay}"/>

                        <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto"
                                      Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhen(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.HasSelection), Mode=OneWay}">
                        <!-- Width-capped + left-aligned: on a wide window the detail stays one compact block
                             instead of spreading its fields (and stranding the button) across the pane.
                             ⚠️ The cap is a star COLUMN's MaxWidth, not the Grid's MaxWidth+Left — a Left-aligned
                             Grid sizes to content, which collapses the * columns and un-pins the button. -->
                        <Grid RowSpacing="12"
                              VerticalAlignment="Top">
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" MaxWidth="760"/>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/> <!-- header: title | chips | action -->
                                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/> <!-- site card: fields | photo -->
                                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/> <!-- stat strip -->
                            </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                            <Grid Grid.Row="0" ColumnSpacing="8">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/> <!-- status chip -->
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/> <!-- network chip -->
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/> <!-- favorite -->
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/> <!-- home -->
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/> <!-- load -->
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                                <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Margin="0,0,16,0">
                                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DetailId, Mode=OneWay}"
                                               FontSize="22" FontWeight="Bold"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DetailName, Mode=OneWay}"
                                               FontSize="13" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"
                                               Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                </StackPanel>

                                <!-- Status chip: neutral pill, the dot is the only colour. -->
                                <Border Grid.Column="1" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                        CornerRadius="11" Padding="10,3"
                                        Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}">
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                        <Ellipse Width="8" Height="8" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                 Fill="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.StatusBrush(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.SelectedSite.Availability), Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.SelectedSite.StatusLabel, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                   FontSize="12"/>
                                        <ctl:GlossaryHint VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                          Card="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.StatusHint, Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Border>

                                <Border Grid.Column="2" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                        CornerRadius="11" Padding="10,3"
                                        Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}">
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DetailClassLabel, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                   FontSize="12"
                                                   Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                        <ctl:GlossaryHint VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                          Card="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.NetworkHint, Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Border>

                                <Button Grid.Column="3" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                        Margin="8,0,0,0"
                                        Click="OnDetailFavoriteClick"
                                        ToolTipService.ToolTip="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.FavoriteToolTip(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.SelectedSite.IsFavorite), Mode=OneWay}">
                                    <FontIcon FontSize="16"
                                              Glyph="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.StarGlyph(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.SelectedSite.IsFavorite), Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                </Button>

                                <Button Grid.Column="4" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                        Click="OnDetailHomeClick"
                                        ToolTipService.ToolTip="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.HomeToolTip(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.SelectedSite.IsHome), Mode=OneWay}">
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                        <FontIcon FontSize="14" Glyph="&#xE80F;"/>
                                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.HomeLabel(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.SelectedSite.IsHome), Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Button>

                                <Button Grid.Column="5" VerticalAlignment="Center" MinWidth="120"
                                        Click="OnLoadClick"
                                        Style="{StaticResource AccentButtonStyle}"
                                        Content="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.LoadButtonText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                        IsEnabled="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.CanLoadOnMap, Mode=OneWay}"/>
                            </Grid>

                            <!-- SITE CARD — the precise form of the facts (a clock time, the full mode line),
                                 with the photo INSIDE the same card on an inset surface. ⚠️ The photo gets a
                                 surface change, NOT its own border: a bordered box inside a bordered card reads
                                 as clutter, and the surface fences it just as well. -->
                            <Border Grid.Row="1" CornerRadius="8" Padding="16" BorderThickness="1"
                                    BorderBrush="{ThemeResource CardStrokeColorDefaultSolidBrush}"
                                    Background="{ThemeResource CardBackgroundFillColorDefaultBrush}">
                                <Grid ColumnSpacing="24">
                                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="200"/>
                                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                                    <!-- Label | value rows, each fenced by a hairline so the eye can cross the
                                         gap to the value with the photo sitting alongside. The LAST row has no
                                         rule (nothing follows it to separate from). -->
                                    <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" VerticalAlignment="Top">
                                        <Border BorderThickness="0,0,0,1" Padding="0,0,0,8"
                                                BorderBrush="{ThemeResource CardStrokeColorDefaultSolidBrush}">
                                            <Grid ColumnSpacing="16">
                                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="110"/>
                                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                <TextBlock Text="LATEST SCAN" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                           Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                                <!-- Spinner and value share ONE cell so the ring never indents the
                                                     value: side by side, an inactive ring still reserves its width
                                                     and pushed this line out of line with every other field. They
                                                     can't collide — the value is empty for exactly as long as the
                                                     fetch is in flight (see LatestScanText). -->
                                                <Grid Grid.Column="1">
                                                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.LatestScanText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                               Style="{StaticResource FieldValueStyle}"/>
                                                    <ProgressRing Width="14"
                                                                  Height="14"
                                                                  HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                                                  VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                                  IsActive="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.IsLoadingScanInfo, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                                  Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhen(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.IsLoadingScanInfo), Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                                </Grid>
                                            </Grid>
                                        </Border>

                                        <Border BorderThickness="0,0,0,1" Padding="0,8"
                                                BorderBrush="{ThemeResource CardStrokeColorDefaultSolidBrush}">
                                            <Grid ColumnSpacing="16">
                                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="110"/>
                                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                <TextBlock Text="SCAN MODE" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                           Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                                <TextBlock Grid.Column="1"
                                                           Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.VcpModeText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                           Style="{StaticResource FieldValueStyle}"/>
                                            </Grid>
                                        </Border>

                                        <Grid ColumnSpacing="16" Margin="0,8,0,0">
                                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="110"/>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <TextBlock Text="COORDINATES" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                       Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="1"
                                                       Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DetailCoords, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                       Style="{StaticResource FieldValueStyle}"/>
                                            <ctl:GlossaryHint Grid.Column="2" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                              Card="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.CoordsHint, Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                        </Grid>
                                    </StackPanel>

                                    <!-- Site photo — DUMMY placeholder; nothing feeds it yet. 16:9. -->
                                    <Border Grid.Column="1" Height="113" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                            CornerRadius="6"
                                            Background="{ThemeResource CardBackgroundFillColorSecondaryBrush}">
                                        <StackPanel HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" Spacing="6">
                                            <FontIcon Glyph="&#xE722;" FontSize="24"
                                                      Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="Site photo" FontSize="12" HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                                                       Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Border>
                                </Grid>
                            </Border>

                            <!-- STAT STRIP — the same facts said SHORT, for the glance that answers "is this
                                 radar worth loading?". Each tile carries its own "?" hint.
                                 ⚠️ The age tile is the only one that carries colour, and its knees are the
                                 glossary's (green → amber at RecentKnee → red past Staleness), so the colour
                                 and the hint's sentence always agree.
                                 ⚠️ The distance tile COLLAPSES with no location marker — an empty tile would
                                 read as missing data rather than as a feature you haven't used. -->
                            <Grid Grid.Row="2" ColumnSpacing="12">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                                <Border Grid.Column="0" CornerRadius="8" Padding="12"
                                        Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}">
                                    <Grid>
                                        <StackPanel>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DetailAgeValue, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                       FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                                       Foreground="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.AgeBrush(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DetailAgeMinutes), Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="SINCE LAST SCAN" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <ctl:GlossaryHint HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                                          Card="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.AgeHint, Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                    </Grid>
                                </Border>

                                <Border Grid.Column="1" CornerRadius="8" Padding="12"
                                        Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}">
                                    <Grid>
                                        <StackPanel>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DetailScanValue, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                       FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DetailScanLabel, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                       Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <ctl:GlossaryHint HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                                          Card="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.ScanHint, Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                    </Grid>
                                </Border>

                                <Border Grid.Column="2" CornerRadius="8" Padding="12"
                                        Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}"
                                        Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhenText(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DetailDistanceValue), Mode=OneWay}">
                                    <Grid>
                                        <StackPanel>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DetailDistanceValue, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                       FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="FROM YOU" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <ctl:GlossaryHint HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                                          Card="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DistanceHint, Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                    </Grid>
                                </Border>
                            </Grid>
                        </Grid>
                        </ScrollViewer>
                    </Grid>
                </Grid>
            </Grid>

        <!-- Lock (no move/resize) + pin (keep on top). -->
        <ctl:LockToggle IsChecked="{x:Bind ViewModel.IsRadarAtlasLocked, Mode=TwoWay}"/>
        <ctl:PinToggle IsChecked="{x:Bind ViewModel.IsRadarAtlasOnTop, Mode=TwoWay}"/>
    </Grid>
</UserControl>
